"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nA science book that interestingly explains science in everyday life.  \nIt unfolds science not as something stiff but as interesting daily life.  \nI used to like psychology, but now brain science catches my eye more.  \nIt seems like a more RAW area for understanding humans. Of course, this thought changed a bit after reading The Selfish Gene...  \nBut still,  is interesting.\n"